		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『あ！？
大バンギラスが▽
海に　帰っていく……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
